<title>HONG KONG: Bank of East Asia sets HK$100 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank of East Asia sets HK$100 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of East Asia Ltd has launched a HK$100 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue due 1998, arranger Tokyo-Mitsubishi International (HK) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue will mature on June 17, 1998. It was issued under the bank's HK$18 billion certificate of deposit programme.</p>
<p>The certificates were priced at par to float at 16 basis points over the three-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Governing law is Hong Kong.  The payment date is June 17.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960  http://www.hk97.com</p>
